# Trempel project

The slot template's skins take shared prefabs (panels, buttons, icons) from the kit's default skin — the `@skin`
collection (package `@trempel/kit`). The game bundles its art through the `#kit-skin` alias of vite.config.ts.

## collections
$skin: npm:@trempel/kit/skins/default/ui

## actions

Actions of this game for the Trempel hub (`trempel run --list` — with the kit's and the hub's).

### fixtures
$title: Rebuild the fixtures
$icon: sparkles
$group: content
$confirm: Rewrites fixtures/*.json and fixtures/5x3/*.json from the hand table of rounds
$shell: node scripts/fixtures.mjs

The synthetic rounds (`scripts/fixtures.mjs`, the hand table) → `fixtures/`, `fixtures/5x3/`.

### dev
$title: Dev server
$icon: play
$group: run
$pin: true
$kind: service
$port: auto
$url: http://localhost:${port}/?skin=default&cheat=1
$shell: npx vite --port ${port} --strictPort

The kit's `dev`, opened on the default skin with the cheat panel.
